{"seq":2,"slug":"claim-data-carrier-score","title":"理赔数据反哺承运商选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/claim-insight-prevention/claim-data-carrier-score","wordCount":2432,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"理赔数据反哺承运商选择\">理赔数据反哺承运商选择</h1><p>两家承运商的报价差 4%，一家每千票有 2.1 票货损、平均回收率 58%，另一家每千票 4.7 票货损、平均回收率 31%。直觉会选便宜的第一家，但真正要算的是<strong>总到岸成本的差异，而不是报价的差异</strong>。这个对比只有在理赔数据被结构化、口径统一、并按承运商聚合之后才能做出来；没有这套数据，&quot;承运商管理&quot;就退化成一年一次的凭印象打分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理赔数据要能反哺承运商选择，必须先把原始索赔记录聚合成<strong>可比的承运商指标</strong>。这里的关键词是&quot;可比&quot;——同一家承运商在不同航线、不同品类上的表现差异可能远大于承运商之间的差异，因此指标必须分层聚合，且每层的样本量要够。</p>\n<p>承运商评分由三类输入构成，它们回答三个不同的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入类别</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>损失发生</td>\n<td>出事的频率与严重度有多高</td>\n<td>破损率、丢失率、每千票损失件数</td>\n<td>收货检验 + 损失认定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索赔表现</td>\n<td>出事之后对方配合不配合</td>\n<td>首次确认时长、受理率、胜率、平均结案时长</td>\n<td>索赔状态机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济结果</td>\n<td>最终花了多少钱</td>\n<td>单位货值回收率、净损失率、处理成本占比</td>\n<td>赔付与回款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>第三类指标才应该进入路由决策，前两类用于诊断。</strong> 只破损率高但赔得快的承运商，其净损失可能低于破损率低但从不认赔的承运商。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[损失认定记录] --&gt; D[承运商指标层]&#10;  B[索赔状态机记录] --&gt; D&#10;  C[赔付与回款记录] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E{分层聚合}&#10;  E --&gt; F[承运商×航线]&#10;  E --&gt; G[承运商×品类]&#10;  E --&gt; H[承运商×交接段]&#10;  F --&gt; I[承运商评分]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[路由权重调整]&#10;  I --&gt; K[年度谈判输入]&#10;  I --&gt; L[低分承运商沙箱/淘汰]\">graph TD\n  A[损失认定记录] --&gt; D[承运商指标层]\n  B[索赔状态机记录] --&gt; D\n  C[赔付与回款记录] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E{分层聚合}\n  E --&gt; F[承运商×航线]\n  E --&gt; G[承运商×品类]\n  E --&gt; H[承运商×交接段]\n  F --&gt; I[承运商评分]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[路由权重调整]\n  I --&gt; K[年度谈判输入]\n  I --&gt; L[低分承运商沙箱/淘汰]</pre><h2 id=\"指标定义与口径\">指标定义与口径</h2><p>指标定义不清是这套系统最常见的失败。下面给出每个指标的精确定义，其中分母的选择尤其重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分母口径的决定性作用\">分母口径的决定性作用</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>分母口径</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>破损率</td>\n<td>认定破损件数 / 承运件数</td>\n<td>按该承运商实际承运的件数</td>\n<td>分母不能用订单数（一件含多件）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢失率</td>\n<td>整件丢失件数 / 承运件数</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>丢失宣告有等待期，数据滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位货值损失率</td>\n<td>认定损失金额 / 承运货值</td>\n<td>按申报货值</td>\n<td>货值口径须统一（见 4.1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受理率</td>\n<td>进入调查的金额 / 提交金额</td>\n<td>按金额而非单数</td>\n<td>单数口径会被小额案稀释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>胜率</td>\n<td>获赔金额 / 进入调查金额</td>\n<td>按金额</td>\n<td>只算已结案，未结案不得计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均结案时长</td>\n<td>提交至结案的日历天数</td>\n<td>只算已结案</td>\n<td><strong>须看 P90 而非均值</strong>（双峰分布）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净损失率</td>\n<td>（认定损失 − 实收赔付 − 保险赔付）/ 承运货值</td>\n<td>按申报货值</td>\n<td>保险赔付需按承运商归因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;只算已结案&quot;是防止指标失真的关键约束。</strong> 如果未结案（可能拖了 200 天且大概率拒赔）被计入分母，短期看胜率会虚高；如果被计入分子又会让结果不可预期。正确做法是把&quot;未结案金额&quot;作为一个独立敞口指标单列，而不是混进胜率。这一约束在承运人侧是有制度支撑的：美国陆运的承运人必须在收到索赔后 30 日内书面确认、120 日内支付/拒绝/提出确定的和解要约，否则此后每 60 日告知状态（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/49/370.9\">49 CFR §370.9</a>），因此&quot;长期未结&quot;本身就是一个可被追责的异常状态，应被显式计入敞口而不是隐入分母。</p>\n<h3 id=\"样本量与置信度\">样本量与置信度</h3><p>按承运商×航线×品类三层切分之后，很多格子的样本量会小到几十件，此时观察到的破损率差异可能是噪声。判断&quot;这家承运商的破损率是否真的更高&quot;需要做置信区间判断，而不是比较点估计。一个可直接落地的近似：破损件数服从二项分布，当样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与破损件数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 都足够大时，破损率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = k/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的标准误为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE(p) = \\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当两家承运商的置信区间不重叠时，才应把差异当作信号。<strong>小样本场景下的替代做法是改用贝叶斯收缩</strong>（把该承运商的观测率向其所属航线/区域的整体率收缩），这样新承运商的初始评分会接近整体均值，而不是被一两票极端样本主导。这在路由权重里非常重要：一个只运过 30 票、碰巧出了 3 票货损的新承运商，不应该被直接判定为&quot;高风险&quot;而永久失去流量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评分模型与路由权重\">评分模型与路由权重</h2><p>评分模型的第一条原则是<strong>可解释</strong>。承运商管理最终要落到与承运商谈判、要求整改，一个黑箱分数无法支撑这些动作。因此推荐用加权分档而非复杂模型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么用加权分档而非模型\">为什么用加权分档而非模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;carrier_score_model&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2026.09&quot;,&#10;    &quot;window_days&quot;: 180,&#10;    &quot;dimensions&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;key&quot;: &quot;loss_frequency&quot;,&#10;        &quot;weight&quot;: 0.3,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;loss_units_per_1k&quot;,&#10;        &quot;direction&quot;: &quot;lower_better&quot;,&#10;        &quot;shrinkage&quot;: { &quot;prior_weight&quot;: 200 }&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;key&quot;: &quot;claim_responsiveness&quot;,&#10;        &quot;weight&quot;: 0.2,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;median_first_ack_days&quot;,&#10;        &quot;direction&quot;: &quot;lower_better&quot;,&#10;        &quot;shrinkage&quot;: { &quot;prior_weight&quot;: 50 }&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;key&quot;: &quot;claim_yield&quot;,&#10;        &quot;weight&quot;: 0.25,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;settle_yield_pct&quot;,&#10;        &quot;direction&quot;: &quot;higher_better&quot;,&#10;        &quot;shrinkage&quot;: { &quot;prior_weight&quot;: 100 }&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;key&quot;: &quot;net_loss_rate&quot;,&#10;        &quot;weight&quot;: 0.25,&#10;        &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;net_loss_per_value&quot;,&#10;        &quot;direction&quot;: &quot;lower_better&quot;,&#10;        &quot;shrinkage&quot;: { &quot;prior_weight&quot;: 150 }&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;min_sample_units&quot;: 200,&#10;    &quot;fallback_score&quot;: 70,&#10;    &quot;tiers&quot;: { &quot;A&quot;: 85, &quot;B&quot;: 72, &quot;C&quot;: 60 }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"carrier_score_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dimensions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"loss_frequency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"loss_units_per_1k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lower_better\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"shrinkage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prior_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claim_responsiveness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"median_first_ack_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lower_better\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"shrinkage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prior_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claim_yield\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settle_yield_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"higher_better\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"shrinkage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prior_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"net_loss_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"net_loss_per_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lower_better\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"shrinkage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"prior_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_sample_units\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fallback_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tiers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其中 <code>shrinkage.prior_weight</code> 控制收缩强度：权重越大，小样本越向整体均值靠拢。<code>min_sample_units</code> 之下的承运商直接用 <code>fallback_score</code>，避免用不可靠数据做流量决策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"评分到路由权重的映射\">评分到路由权重的映射</h3><p>评分不是直接变成路由权重，中间需要一层&quot;业务约束&quot;过滤。原因是路由决策的目标函数不只是&quot;少赔钱&quot;，还包括时效、覆盖能力与成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>承运商分档</th>\n<th>路由权重调整</th>\n<th>附加约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>权重 +20%，优先分配高价值货</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>权重不变</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>权重 −30%</td>\n<td>高价值货需二次确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D（低于最低线）</td>\n<td>移出常规池</td>\n<td>仅保留小批量试运，设观察期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新承运商</td>\n<td>按整体均值权重</td>\n<td>样本达 min_sample_units 前不调整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>对高价值货的差异化分配是本 hub 与正向履约链路最重要的接口。</strong> 一家承运商的破损率对 50 美元的货和 5,000 美元的货造成的损失完全不同：低价值货的破损损失可能低于为降低破损而多付的运费，高价值货则相反。因此路由决策应该按货值分层，而不是按承运商整体评分一刀切。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从评分到动作\">从评分到动作</h3><p>指标本身不产生收益，动作才产生。下表把评分结果映射到具体动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>时间窗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>净损失率环比上升 &gt; 50%</td>\n<td>启动承运商约谈，要求根因说明</td>\n<td>物流运营</td>\n<td>30 日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次确认时长中位数 &gt; 45 日</td>\n<td>在合同中要求书面 SLA</td>\n<td>采购/法务</td>\n<td>下次续签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受理率 &lt; 60%</td>\n<td>审查提交质量，联合复盘单证清单</td>\n<td>索赔团队</td>\n<td>30 日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某航线破损率显著高于同组</td>\n<td>现场考察 + 包装适配评估</td>\n<td>物流运营 + 包装</td>\n<td>60 日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分档跌至 D</td>\n<td>移出常规池，启动替代承运商</td>\n<td>物流运营</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意第一行与第四行的区别：前者是<strong>对方的问题</strong>（约谈承运商），后者可能是<strong>自己的问题</strong>（该航线货型与包装不匹配，见 <a href=\"packaging-loss-prevention\">包装/操作改进与损失预防</a>）。归因错了，动作就会做在错误的对象上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量与归因\">数据质量与归因</h2><p>理赔数据反哺的可靠性取决于两件事：<strong>损失是否被完整记录</strong>与<strong>损失是否被正确归因到承运商</strong>。两者都有系统性偏差。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>漏记偏差</strong>：低于免赔额或低于处理成本阈值的损失常不被立案（见 <a href=\"../cargo-insurance-claim/deductible-exclusion-handle\">免赔额与除外责任的处理</a>），因此承运商指标只反映了&quot;值得索赔的损失&quot;，而不是全部损失。若不修正，评分会系统性低估那些&quot;损失小但频繁&quot;的承运商的问题。修正方法是在收货检验环节无条件记录所有异常（无论是否索赔），把&quot;损失发生&quot;与&quot;损失索赔&quot;两个数据集分开统计。</li>\n<li><strong>归因偏差</strong>：多式联运下责任段判定依赖交接快照完整度，缺失时会归到合同相对方（总承运人），使实际出事的承运商逃脱统计。修正方法是同时维护&quot;责任段归属&quot;与&quot;合同相对方&quot;两个维度（见 <a href=\"../loss-damage-determine/responsibility-segment-attribute\">责任段划分与责任方归属</a>），评分按责任段归属口径计算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承运商评分由三类输入构成：<strong>损失发生</strong>（诊断）、<strong>索赔表现</strong>（诊断）、<strong>经济结果</strong>（进路由决策）。</li>\n<li>指标分母必须统一：破损/丢失率的分母是承运件数，受理率/胜率按金额，<strong>只算已结案</strong>，未结案金额单列为敞口指标。</li>\n<li>平均结案时长必须看 P90 —— 索赔时长常呈双峰分布，均值落在没有案例的谷底。</li>\n<li>小样本必须做<strong>置信区间判断或贝叶斯收缩</strong>；新承运商的初始评分应接近整体均值，不应被一两票极端样本主导。</li>\n<li>评分模型应<strong>可解释</strong>（加权分档而非黑箱）；评分到路由权重之间需要一层业务约束过滤。</li>\n<li><strong>路由决策应按货值分层</strong>——同一破损率对 50 美元与 5,000 美元的货含义完全不同。</li>\n<li>数据质量有两个系统性偏差：漏记（小额损失不立案）与归因（交接快照缺失导致归错对象），两者都需在采集侧修正而非在报表侧修补。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>承运商评分指向&quot;向谁买&quot;，最后一步是&quot;自己怎么改&quot;——这是 <a href=\"packaging-loss-prevention\">包装/操作改进与损失预防</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理赔数据反哺承运商选择","id":"理赔数据反哺承运商选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指标定义与口径","id":"指标定义与口径"},{"level":3,"text":"分母口径的决定性作用","id":"分母口径的决定性作用"},{"level":3,"text":"样本量与置信度","id":"样本量与置信度"},{"level":2,"text":"评分模型与路由权重","id":"评分模型与路由权重"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么用加权分档而非模型","id":"为什么用加权分档而非模型"},{"level":3,"text":"评分到路由权重的映射","id":"评分到路由权重的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"从评分到动作","id":"从评分到动作"},{"level":2,"text":"数据质量与归因","id":"数据质量与归因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"赔付金额计算与多币种折算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/claim-insight-prevention/claim-amount-calc"},"next":{"title":"包装与操作改进驱动的损失预防","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/shipping-damage-freight-claims/claim-insight-prevention/packaging-loss-prevention"}}